From ae2620c15cb0aaf34ef56d7bd6dc620655c91ff4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:28:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gate): plan one step for each test binary in quick,
 batch and release

The debug suites use the planner pattern of the heavy lanes (#1714): one
build step, then one step for each lib, bins, binary and doc target. Each
step has its own log, time and pass or fail line, and --only / --failed
select one binary. Slow binaries stay out of batch as before.

Fixes #1941

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
